{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22449","headline":"寄王质夫 · 白居易","name":"寄王质夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆始识君时，爱君世缘薄。\n我亦吏王畿，不爲名利着。\n春寻仙游洞，秋上云居阁。\n楼观水潺潺，龙潭花漠漠。\n吟诗石上坐，引酒泉边酌。\n因话出处心，心期老岩壑。\n忽从风雨别，遂被簪缨缚。\n君作出山云，我爲入笼鹤。\n笼深鹤残顇，山远云飘泊。\n去处虽不同，同负平生约。\n今来各何在，老去随所托。\n我守巴南城，君佐征西幕。\n年颜渐衰飒，生计仍萧索。\n方含去国愁，且羡从军乐。\n旧游疑是梦，往事思如昨。\n相忆春又深，故山花正落。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22449.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22449","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}